ndhotelpreanger","bandung"],"summary":"Although less well-known than the Savoy Homann, the Preanger hotel has a history dating back to the 19th century. The current building dates from 1925 and is based on a design by Dutch architect C.P.W. Schoemaker. The facade combines Art Deco style with local cultural elements, which was controversial when it was constructed.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Bandung/Central","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Bandung_-_Hotel_Preanger_%282025%29_-_img_01.jpg/1280px-Bandung_-_Hotel_Preanger_%282025%29_-_img_01.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Bandung_-_Hotel_Preanger_%282025%29_-_img_01.jpg/500px-Bandung_-_Hotel_Preanger_%282025%29_-_img_01.jpg","w":1200,"h":900,"author":"Chainwit.","license":"CC BY 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bandung_-_Hotel_Preanger_(2025)_-_img_01.jpg"}}],"sources":["Wikidata (CC0)","Wikimedia Commons (counts; photos credited per file)","Wikipedia (pageviews; summaries CC BY-SA 4.0)","Wikivoyage (listings: hours, prices, descriptions; CC BY-SA 4.0)","OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL): opening hours, fees, websites"]}